main = draw x = Normal in if Uniform < 0.3 then (if x > 0.0 then x else 0.0) else 1.0
-- Task world-residual-factor-delegation: an x-free condition that draws fresh
-- randomness splits the worlds like an x-dependent one, each polarity carrying
-- P(Uniform < 0.3 = polarity) as a world factor.
-- p(0.5) = 0.3 * phi(0.5); p(0.0) = 0.3 * P(x <= 0) = 0.15; p(1.0) = 0.7 (the
-- atom wins over the then-arm's density there).
-- cdf(0.5) = 0.3 * Phi(0.5).
